      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The kobold trapmaster deploys one of their spike traps in an adjacent square.\n\n---\n\nOnce this trap is deployed in a square, it deals 2d8 piercing damage to anyone who steps on that square and they must attempt a DC 17 basic Reflex save saving throw. A hero takes no damage on a critical success, half damage on a success, full damage on a failure, and double damage on a critical failure. These traps can be disabled with a successful DC 15 Thievery check check."
